<section class="bg-primary py-14 md:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1240px] px-6 md:px-10">
    <div class="grid overflow-hidden md:grid-cols-2">
      <div
        class="bg-[#222222] px-8 py-9 text-white md:px-11 md:py-10 lg:px-12 lg:py-11 animate-fade-right"
      >
        <h2 class="text-white">
          Our <span class="font-semibold">Story</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-5 font-semibold">
          At ProPlumb, plumbing is more than pipes and fittings. It’s about
          trust, structure, reliability, and disciplined site safety inclusion.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-7 space-y-6">
          <p class="">
            Since our beginnings, we have focused on delivering civil, drainage,
            and plumbing solutions that support predictable construction
            outcomes, while investing in the people and systems that make that
            possible.
          </p>

          <p class="">
            What started in a garage has grown into a team of over 80
            professionals operating from a purpose-built headquarters. Today,
            our work is defined by clear communication, disciplined planning,
            and long-term partnerships with Australia's leading builders and
            developers.
          </p>

          <p class="">
            From the field to the office, our team brings deep experience and
            practical problem-solving to every project. Whether it's a complex
            civil scope or a residential build, we approach each job with the
            same expectation: deliver it as planned, and stand behind the
